## What was split

The original #4471 summary said one issue and one fix. Tenant configuration and the rendered components show separate parser and booking-form hint mechanisms. Subjects and browser intake tags cannot establish a common cause. The report counts below use the supplied code and tenant directory, deduplicated by report ID.

